<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/0019449eac9a2cec>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The failure raised when a Clifford algebra lacks its scalar field, signature, basis blades, grading, product/involution frame, or exact vector-space dimension."@en .

