<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1b105e1d82f96d4d>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The meaning assignment from `rev` to the class math:Reversion; it deliberately carries no executable grapheme."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1b2afe5c97ca40d2>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "linkage floor — Linked"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1b376141c82db598>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The failure raised when a math:Compactification does not name all four of its roles — its original space (math:originalSpace), its compactifying map (math:compactifyingMap), its compactified space (math:compactifiedSpace), and its boundary at infinity (math:boundaryAtInfinity) — or when a math:ConformalCompactification additionally omits its math:conformalFactor. A compactification that does not say what it embeds, by which map, into what, and with which boundary at infinity is ill-formed. Mirrors math:UnderspecifiedManifold and math:UnderspecifiedChart."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1b3dbef9c5087101>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "When logic:consequent is present, require one resource-valued logic:antecedent before constructing Formula::Implies."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1b4da4972e7df7e6>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "projection-ceiling commitment — kernel / gufo"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1b79689122da4896>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The number a math:NumberLiteral leaf denotes: relates a math:NumberLiteral expression node to the math:Number it stands for. Domain math:NumberLiteral, range math:Number (stated in prose). The value is a well-formed math:Number situated in a number system, not a bare RDF literal — this is the seam by which a syntactic literal leaf of a formula names an exact numeric object rather than carrying an opaque decimal."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1b9b5e328bd66740>
