<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1de4148630150d66>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The operation selecting the homogeneous component of a multivector at a declared grade. It is not coordinate selection or extraction of one basis coefficient."@en .

