    ontolex:writtenRep "slice quality tier"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1e8453e41f28fc3c>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Requires every logic:Formula to select exactly one constructor family: atomic relation, strong negation, conjunction, disjunction, material implication (keyed by logic:antecedent), biconditional, universal quantification, or existential quantification. It does not choose among serialized operands; it prevents one node from having two incompatible logical meanings."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1e92145b771f2812>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Relates a math:Estimand to the outcome it is defined on — the measured quantity (a math:StatisticalVariable or outcome measure) whose value the estimand summarizes across the target population. Domain math:Estimand, range the target outcome (stated in prose). One of the six framing coordinates; the same population and contrast over a different outcome is a different estimand."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1ec8943ebf011201>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "dict-v3 entry: math:Reversion to rev"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1ed27cba79393030>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "projection"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1eead9ebeeda9214>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Projection Ceiling Commitment"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1ef9e48b0210206b>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "A guard-only relation inside a reified constraint formula whose second argument carries the SELECT text defining a focus set. It is not a data-triple relation; the SHACL lowering consumes it as a first-class sh:SPARQLTarget and removes the guard from the violation body."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1f25727b5be77d03>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "A scale-indexed subcomplex of a Delaunay complex that captures the homotopy type of the union of restricted balls. It is not the full Delaunay complex or an arbitrary proximity complex."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1f483e9b935a23fc>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Reject a carrier unless exactly one of the four term-value predicates has exactly one value."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1f721aed3e8b6a99>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Quadratic Space"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1fc50f0ba52855fa>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The failure raised when a math:EffectSize does not identify all three of the frame that makes its magnitude interpretable: the comparison it measures through math:effectSizeContrast (a math:StatisticalContrast), the scale it is expressed on through math:effectSizeScale (a math:MeasurementScale), and its reference frame through gmeow:hasReferenceFrame. An effect size missing any of the three is an uninterpretable bare number — a magnitude with no comparison, no units of comparison, or no frame it is expressed in."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/1fe9c6a04b00768e>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "dict-v3 entry: instrumental reading to inst"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/201e207e1481138c>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "A decomposition of one mathematical object into explicitly named summands with zero pairwise intersection and a jointly exhaustive span in the declared category."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/203b8d43e0fab33e>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Persistence Barcode"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/2076a23ac16ea75b>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The committed lower-only ungrounded-residue ceiling for the sh projection vocabulary on the pipeline slice; the gate reds if the slice's measured residue rises above it."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/209c83016d87c8b7>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "sell"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/20ed999e67aa7b1c>
