<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/4a61064f982a5051>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The committed lower-only ungrounded-residue ceiling for the bfo projection vocabulary on the affect slice; the gate reds if the slice's measured residue rises above it."@en .

