<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/4aa83c2170b9e077>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Relates a Hodge decomposition to its exact component — the part lying in the image of the applicable boundary or coboundary operator. Domain math:HodgeDecomposition, range math:ExactComponent (stated in prose)."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/4aaca66a0f527de2>
    a ontolex:Form ;
