<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/52f7afc0dd6c9322>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The version-3 alias binding for gmeow:methodInstrumentalReading: `inst`, retained unchanged from version 2."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/5312234a2f9ca6c2>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "An analysis activity that maps data to a declared lower-dimensional representation and records its input, target dimension, and output embedding."@en .

