<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/65d8009685a8dfbb>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The single, ontology-resident rubric the slice-quality advisor binds to: a Profile over gmeow:Slice whose descriptor properties are the axis bindings and whose open value vocabularies are the axes, tiers, and context scopes. Tuning a threshold, minting a tier, or adding an axis is a slice edit and regenerate — never a code fork; Rust supplies only the closed measurement primitives the descriptors name. It is NOT the assessment output (that is gmeow:QualityAssessment) — it is the schema the scorer reads."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/65dfb52c364f2418>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The projection-axis score floor to earn the Linked tier."@en .

