<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/6812bfd47bea13b7>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The axis that dogfoods the native reasoner as the instrument: inferential density, closure-redundancy and asserted-derived-fact detection by proof, inferential centrality, competency-lane analysis, negative-space verification, and conjecture-backed advice. It is NOT a text heuristic — every metric reads the materialized closure and derivation graph (Principles 8/17/18)."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/6842ced86f49466c>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The version-3 alias binding for gmeow:methodComputationalModel: `cmp`, retained unchanged from version 2."@en .

