<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/692b6ceea9dc63d8>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Accept zero or one datatype IRI only on a carrier whose sole value kind is logic:termLiteral."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/6946d4944cf7f3fb>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:AtomicConstraint binds exactly one of gmeow:rightOperand (a literal value) or gmeow:rightOperandReference (an IRI reference), never both and never neither."@en .

