<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/6f35de53e85283b7>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The target-language rendering a glossary entry binds its English source to — the non-fuzzy msgstr the catalog carries. Functional: one translation per entry. Domain gmeow:GlossaryEntry, range xsd:string. Two entries sharing a gmeow:glossaryConcept must carry the same gmeow:glossaryTranslation (lang:GlossaryTermConsistencyConstraint)."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/6f60126ce2f3180b>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "dict-v3 entry: possible modal force to poss"@en .

