    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The degree-wise operator formed from a boundary or coboundary and its adjoint, whose kernel is the harmonic component."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/6f9134794216c47c>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The top of the lattice: every axis at its richest configuration — maximal grounding, linkage, projection, testing, documentation, prose quality, and full tri-language translation. The bar the grounding slices and this rubric slice itself must meet."@en .

