<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/8ae44a751d8670bd>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Relates a Hodge decomposition to the cellular sheaf whose sheaf Laplacian and coboundary maps define its exact, coexact, and harmonic subspaces. Domain math:HodgeDecomposition, range math:CellularSheaf (stated in prose). The carrier is part of the decomposition's frame, never implicit; a decomposition missing it is ill-formed (math:IncompleteHodgeDecomposition)."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/8b2f2a7537211f4d>
    a ontolex:Form ;
