    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "dict-v3 entry: gmeow:GmnCodebook to gcb"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ecf96ddcb1022131>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Translation Unit"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ed021fe1b6db5c1d>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "constant"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ed077d25022559ca>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The committed maximum ungrounded-residue count (a non-negative integer) a per-(slice,vocabulary) ceiling commitment pins — the value the slice's measured residue for that vocabulary may fall below but never exceed, and which may itself only fall (or be removed) across a base-vs-working comparison, never rise. It is NOT a gmeow:floorValue (that is a raise-only decimal score floor) and NOT the live measured count (that is computed by the shared counter): it is the lower-only, integer-exact regression ceiling for one slice's one vocabulary."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ed2d0b6d07a5f527>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "testing floor — Maximal"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ed36a3e723266690>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Dictionary version 3 of the GMN alias table: an immutable successor to version 2 that retains all 24 prior bindings on version-owned entries and adds `boundary`, `coboundary`, `ds`, `lcon`, `rev`, and `hlap` for the audited mathematics named keys."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ed5084e5700e058b>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "represented object"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/eddb3c6741010480>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Maximal Projection"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ee190fd186c6e985>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The defining law of math:convexity as a first-order logic:Formula over the reified real/value signature, in the honestly-expressible MIDPOINT form: for a function f declared convex, for all x, y with domain midpoint m = (x+y)/2 and value midpoint z = (f(x)+f(y))/2, the value w = f(m) satisfies w ≤ z. math: expresses the law; logic: owns reasoning over it. The full λ-chord inequality f(λx+(1−λ)y) ≤ λf(x)+(1−λ)f(y) quantifies over the continuum of λ and needs scalar arithmetic on values, exceeding the first-order fragment without inventing arithmetic function symbols; the midpoint form (reifying the midpoint as the uninterpreted relation math:midpointRel, as math:preimageRel reifies the preimage) is the faithful first-order law, and the λ-general residue is disclosed here, never silently faked."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/eeb0a9149ab1b3a5>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "process personal data"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/eeba6ac1abc4c65d>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "reasoner floor — Linked"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/eedfb3de9ed842b9>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Permission"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ef3a759cfb4a20d3>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Clifford Conjugation"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ef8e74b5c6503796>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "An ordered record of intermediate representations and transformations in a staged dimensionality-reduction procedure."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/efb62edc976ce121>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "public domain"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/efd90a2e737ad4bb>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "A decomposition of an algebra or module into indexed homogeneous components together with the law governing how operations combine their grades. It is not a mere partition or labeling of elements."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/efdcdbef879d4c7e>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "no copyright — United States"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/effeb9e034c081aa>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The explicit rejection of a centred dot as a flattened alias for math:GeometricProduct."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/f00bd6e6f243cc1e>
    a ontolex:Form ;
