    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "has value"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/fe84967b900f56d6>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The testing-axis score floor to earn the Maximal tier."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/fea32c6e9b8dc529>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "exact–coexact inner product"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/fea75b3f18010919>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Entity Existence"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/fedff4ec8236a5d9>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "denotation of the GMN coboundary-operator key"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/fefaf452dbb6c19b>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "Relates a Mapper construction to the math:Cover of its filter function's codomain — the finite, overlapping family of cover elements whose inverse images are clustered and whose overlaps create the nerve's edges. Domain math:MapperConstruction, range math:Cover (stated in prose). The cover is declared and finitely enumerated, never an implicit resolution/gain parameter; a construction missing it is ill-formed (math:IncompleteMapperConstruction)."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ff056c3cf16e5a58>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "module extension summand"@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ff973c98a3d94ef3>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "The prose justification for the exemption — why the producer is genuinely unlanded and why the axis's headline still functions without it. It must cite doctrine, never a ticket number."@en .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-src/ffa9b7e0894bfdb1>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "A logic:TermCarrier with logic:termVariable 'x' but no logic:termIndex violates this constraint."@en .

