<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-tgt/b3a833b5c3244868>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "一个双侧备择：极端性在两尾中度量，因而任一方向的偏离都计为不利于零假设。"@zh .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-tgt/b3b6da3dd44a795b>
    a ontolex:Form ;
