<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-tgt/bf3ca8de74b3d716>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "一条精确尾：p 值使用精确的（通常离散的）尾概率，而非连续近似。"@zh .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-tgt/bf5625ceae2970b0>
