<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-tgt/c0c666c305d30c63>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "将数学分析活动关联到其产生的显式结果对象；结果解释仍是独立的立场索引主张。"@zh .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-tgt/c0ce5f7b0e785290>
