<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-tgt/f84decd518a0c71a>
    a ontolex:Form ;
    ontolex:writtenRep "属于限定 logic:onClass 或 logic:onDataRange 的 logic:onProperty 值的含端点最大数量。限定范围外的填充值不计入，并降低为 owl:maxQualifiedCardinality。"@zh .

<http://example.org/lang/glossary-vartrans/form-tgt/f84e145784933eb6>
    a ontolex:Form ;
